# The title card in every region of the world: a jump into each region names the place (the
# region, or its named place), the home's panels fold away, the map and journal stay; every name
# is drawable (the coverage test checks each string against the fonts).
set clock day
set world district:academy/grove 1
wait 2
expect region academy
expect away yes
expect widget build no
expect widget map yes
expect widget journal yes
